5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I want to make sure we create a space where everyone feels connected and happy. I'll look into the two project strands from last spring and what this year's two joiners reported.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll look into the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I want to be sure we aren't overspending. I'll look into the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm so excited to get this sorted! I want to know how our daily flow is affected, so I'll check the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs and the unplanned seat shuffles from last year.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll take the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check. Let's see if we can actually prioritize something other than just ""vibes"" or budgets.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,It is wonderful that we are all looking at this from different angles. I think understanding how our new colleagues feel will really help us be more welcoming.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,It is a practical approach. I believe focusing on the financial and technical constraints first will prevent us from making unrealistic plans.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. I just don't want us to run into any trouble later because we didn't check the costs carefully enough.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,I totally get that! But I also think it's important to know if we're spending too much of our actual time just getting settled. Let's make sure the new layout doesn't make our mornings a hassle!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Efficiency is great, but it's useless if we're all too stiff to move by 3 PM. I'm interested to see if the physical reality of the room matches the fancy drawings.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I believe we should all be patient with one another as we find the best solution. I am looking forward to seeing how we can support our new joiners.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Consistency is key. If we understand the billing and power constraints now, we can avoid the frustration of a plan that is rejected by management for being too expensive.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I hope that's true. I just worry that if we don't know the exact numbers, we might be putting too much pressure on the budget.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm sure we can find a balance! I just don't want us to end up with a ""perfect"" plan that actually makes our daily routine a total nightmare. Let's keep the human side in mind!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"The ""human side"" usually just means people's whims, Mio. I'm looking for the actual data on how this room affects our bodies and ears. That's the only way to avoid a disaster.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I think we have a very balanced set of goals. Let's see what we discover and work together to find a layout that makes everyone feel at home.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
